28
00:02:32.555 --> 00:02:47.370
<v Maya>So Benjamin Bloom published this paper based on the dissertations of two University of Chicago doctoral students. Their names were Anania and Burke. Okay. They took students in grades four, five, and eight and randomly assigned them to three distinct learning</v>

29
00:02:47.410 --> 00:02:48.611
