66
00:06:30.828 --> 00:06:44.577
<v Maya>Well, tutorial instruction, as we know, gave that 2.0 sigma effect. But he looked at others too. Reinforcement yielded a 1.2 effect. Feedback corrective mastery learning was 1.0. Cooperative learning was</v>

67
00:06:44.597 --> 00:06:45.838
